Kito leaves his home in Tanzania to do some soul-searching aboard after failing to become a landmine removal rat like the rest of his family. He also attempted to become a disease detection or illegal wildlife detection rat. 
Kito the Giant Pouched Rat landed in Newark Liberty International Airport due to him mistaking Newark for New York. As a result, he traveled from NJ to Staten Island where he will start near Fort Wadsworth.
From Staten Island, he will run on the bridge to Brooklyn. 
From Brooklyn through Queens to Manhattan, he takes various trains, transfering along the way. The residents are unfazed by the human-sized rodent, assuming he's just a cosplayer. 
Once he reaches Manhattan, he acquires a bicycle and rode it all the way to the Bronx where his journey will end. 
SECRET: If he acquires the photos of all landmark locations, it will trigger a secret ending where he meets the mayor (Make sure it's low quality)
